('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201', 3, 'post_test', 'In nature, what eventually happens to a population showing J-shaped exponential growth?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Limiting factors stop growth; it either crashes or levels into an S-shaped curve', 'The correct term is: Limiting factors stop growth; it either crashes or levels into an S-shaped curve.', true),
