('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000203', 1, 'pre_test', 'The Philippines sits between:', 'Nazca and South American Plates', 'Indian and African Plates', 'Philippine Sea Plate and Eurasian Plate', 'Pacific and North American Plates', 'C', 'Option C is the correct answer.', true),
('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000203', 1, 'pre_test', 'Many Philippine volcanoes and trenches exist because:', 'No plate motion', 'Several plates are subducting around us', 'We are on a hot spot only', 'Plates are moving apart', 'B', 'Option B is the correct answer.', true),
