('b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000204', 1, 'pre_test', 'Climate change includes:', 'Only hotter summers', 'Changes in rainfall, sea level, and temperature', 'Daily weather changes only', 'Air pollution only', 'B', 'Option B is the correct answer.', true),
